{"path":"container/map/insert_range","title":"std::map<Key,T,Compare,Allocator>::insert_range","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::map&lt;Key,T,Compare,Allocator&gt;::</span>insert_range","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/map/insert_range","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Inserts a copy of each element in the range rg if and only if there is no element with key equivalent to the key of that element in *this.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to\"><span class=\"kw100\">container-compatible-range</span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>value_type<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> R <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> insert_range<span class=\"br0\">(</span> R<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> rg <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Inserts a copy of each element in the range <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> if and only if there is no element with key equivalent to the key of that element in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>.\n</p><p>Each iterator in the range <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> is dereferenced exactly once.\nThe behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> overlaps with the container.\n</p><p>No iterators or references are invalidated.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rg\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to#container_compatible_range\">container compatible range</a>, that is, an <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/input_range\"><code>input_range</code></a> whose elements are convertible to <code>T</code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-hitem\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> Type requirements\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par-req\">\n<td colspan=\"3\"> -<div class=\"spacer\"></div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/map#Member_types\"><code>value_type</code></a> must be <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/EmplaceConstructible\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">EmplaceConstructible</em></a> into <code>map</code> from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"><span class=\"kw2900\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. Otherwise, the behavior is undefined.\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">N·log<span class=\"br0\">(</span>a.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> N<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, where <code>N</code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ranges/distance\"><span class=\"kw3160\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">distance</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable ftm-begin ftm-has-value\">\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/feature_test\">Feature-test</a> macro</th>\n<th><abbr>Value</abbr></th>\n<th><abbr>Std</abbr></th>\n<th>Feature\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/feature_test#cpp_lib_containers_ranges\"><code>__cpp_lib_containers_ranges</code></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/compiler_support/23#cpp_lib_containers_ranges_202202L\"><code>202202L</code></a></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark\">(C++23)</span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to#container_compatible_range\">Ranges-aware</a> construction and insertion\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;map&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;utility&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> container<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"br0\">[</span>key, value<span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> container<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'{'</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> key <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">','</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> value <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'}'</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> container <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/map\"><span class=\"kw1289\">std::<span class=\"me2\">map</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/pair\"><span class=\"kw1104\">std::<span class=\"me2\">pair</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">11</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">33</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">22</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">44</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> rg <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/pair\"><span class=\"kw1104\">std::<span class=\"me2\">pair</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">11</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">33</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">22</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#ifdef __cpp_lib_containers_ranges</span>\n    container.<span class=\"me1\">insert_range</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#else</span>\n    container.<span class=\"me1\">insert</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, rg.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#endif</span>\n    println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"{}\"</span>, container<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>{-2,-22} {-1,-11} {1,11} {2,22} {3,33} {4,44}</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/map/insert\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>insert</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  inserts elements <span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-cxx17\"><span>or nodes</span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span></span></span> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/map","title":"std::map"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::map<Key,T,Compare,Allocator>::insert_range","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Inserts a copy of each element in the range rg if and only if there is no element with key equivalent to the key of…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"rg"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"N·log(a.size() + N), where N is ranges::distance(rg)."},{"label":"Notes"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"insert","note":"inserts elements or nodes(since C++17)"}]}]},"standards":["C++17","C++23"],"wordCount":211,"codeBloc